% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Publications page (/publications/). While this file has no entry, the site
% has no Publications page and no menu link.
%
% Plain BibTeX, one entry per work. The page groups entries by type:
%   Publications       @article, @inproceedings, @incollection, @book, ...
%   Preprints          @unpublished, or any entry with an arXiv eprint
%   Reports & theses   @techreport, @mastersthesis, @phdthesis, @thesis
%   Talks & posters    @misc whose howpublished/note mentions a talk or poster
% `category = {publication|preprint|report|talk|other}` overrides the guess.
%
% Standard fields give the text (author, title, journal / booktitle /
% institution, year, note, doi, eprint, url). These extra fields add links and
% are left out of the BibTeX shown to readers:
%   pdf, code, slides, poster, video   links (a /files/... path or a URL)
%   post                               a related blog post, e.g. /blog/nirs-spectroscopy/vae/
%   abstract                           shown folded under the entry
% Put PDFs in static/files/ (static/files/x.pdf is served at /files/x.pdf).
% Your own name is highlighted in author lists.
%
% Example (remove the leading "% " to use it):
%
% @techreport{tabary2025nirs,
%   author      = {Tabary, Lucas and Doe, Jane},
%   title       = {Latent Space Exploration of {NIRS} Measurements of Plant Specimens},
%   institution = {Telecom Nancy, Universit{\'e} de Lorraine},
%   type        = {Research initiation project report},
%   year        = {2025},
%   month       = jun,
%   pdf         = {/files/nirs-report.pdf},
%   code        = {https://github.com/lucastabary/PIDR_RICOCHET},
%   post        = {/blog/nirs-spectroscopy/},
% }
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
